>Sambrook</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Russell</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><source>Molecular cloning : a laboratory manual</source><year>2001</year><edition>3</edition><publisher-name>Cold Spring Harbor, N.Y.: Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B24"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>Kieser</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Bibb</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Buttner</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Chater</surname><given-names>KF</given-names></name><name><surname>Hopwood</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><source>Practical <italic>Streptomyces </italic>Genetics</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Norwich: John Innes Foundation</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B25"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>MacNeil</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gewain</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruby</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Dezeny</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Gibbons</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>MacNeil</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><article-title>Analysis of <italic>Streptomyces avermitilis </italic>genes required for avermectin biosynthesis utilizing a novel integration vector</article-title><source>Gene</source><year>1992</year><volume>111</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>61</fpage><lpage>68</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0378-1119(92)90603-M</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1547955</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>